Fonts, icons and other assets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------

Where the UI loads webfonts or icon sets, each carries its own licence in the
package that supplies it. Nothing in this repository redistributes a font file
under Whity's own licence.

================================================================================
REGENERATING THIS FILE
================================================================================

The counts above are measured, not estimated:

    composer:  php -r '$l=json_decode(file_get_contents("composer.lock"),true);
               foreach($l["packages"] as $p)
                 echo $p["name"]," ",implode(",",$p["license"]??[]),"\n";'

    npm:       node -e 'const l=require("./package-lock.json");
               const c={}; for(const p of Object.values(l.packages))
                 if(p.license) c[p.license]=(c[p.license]||0)+1;
               console.log(c)'

Re-run both after any dependency change that adds a package, and update this
file if a copyleft licence appears that is not listed above.
